# Firebase
# Client config IS committed on purpose: google-services.json, the iOS
# GoogleService-Info.plist and firebase_options.dart contain only PUBLIC
# client API keys (the security boundary is Firebase Rules + auth), and the
# app cannot build or connect without them.

# Assets
# `assets/images/` and `assets/icons/` are tracked via `.gitkeep` because
# pubspec.yaml declares them — a fresh clone needs the dirs to exist.

